{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.zhengzhi.2021b.q33.material.recovered", "text": "小张是一名道德与法治学科的新教师，在学校拜王老师为师。小张经常听王老师的课，听一节，自己仿照着上一节。三周后，王老师要听小张的课，小张为此很紧张。为了准备这节课，他天天埋头在电脑上下载课件、图片及相关资料，进行整合，制作了课件，并撰写了非常详实的教案，请王老师审阅。王老师针对小张课件，教案中的问题，提出了修改意见，经王老师指点后，小张又几经修改，上了一节课。王老师听课后，与小张老师进行交流，指出了教学中存在的问题，听了王老师的点评，小张很是困惑，自己为了这节课准备了一个多星期，而王老师并没有像自己那样殚精竭虑地备课，但课却上得轻松自然，课堂气氛活跃，这是为什么呢？", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "432507c5c65ab067176afd1669be82acb4955dd88199b03ce393cd3eff4bc180", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3592, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3877, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 33, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "432507c5c65ab067176afd1669be82acb4955dd88199b03ce393cd3eff4bc180"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.zhengzhi.2021b.q33"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.zhengzhi.s1.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.zhengzhi.s1.k07", "ntce.chuzhong.zhengzhi.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.309.r002", "ntce.outline.309.r009", "ntce.outline.309.r012"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.zhengzhi.2021b.q33"], "word_count": 285, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "zhengzhi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "432507c5c65ab067176afd1669be82acb4955dd88199b03ce393cd3eff4bc180", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3592, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3877, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_w